# SEO Engineering

## Metadata (Next.js App Router)
```tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: "...",
  description: "...",
  openGraph: {
    title, description, images: [{ url: "/og.png" }],
    locale: "vi_VN", type: "website",
  },
  robots: { index: true, follow: true },
};
```
- Title độc nhất, ≤ 60 ký tự.
- Description ≤ 160 ký tự.

## Structured Data (JSON-LD)
- Dùng cho knowledge posts: `@type: Article`, author, datePublished.
- Dùng cho hugs: `@type: CreativeWork`.

## URL structure
- Cố định slug: lowercase, hyphen-separated.
- Canonical trùng với URL thực tế.

## robots.txt (root)
```
User-agent: *
Disallow: /dashboard/
Allow: /
Sitemap: https://tramdungtamhon.vn/sitemap.xml
```

## Open Graph image (`public/og.png`)
- Kích thước: 1200×630px.
- Font: Playfair Display, màu nền `primary`.